---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy notice (PDPA) | Singapore Business Broker"
  description="How Singapore Business Broker collects, uses and protects personal data under Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act."
  noindex
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="PDPA" title="Privacy notice" crumbs={[{ href: '/privacy', label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <section class="max-w-wrap mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8 pb-28 lg:pb-40">
    <div class="prose-sbb reveal">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs">
        Template notice, accurate to how the site currently works. Have it reviewed by your own counsel before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a brand of {site.parentLegal}, Singapore. For questions about personal data, contact
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Details you submit through the valuation estimator: sector, revenue band, profit, years operating, ownership, owner dependency, timeline, and your name, email and mobile number.</li>
        <li>Details you submit through the contact form: enquiry type, name, email, mobile number and your message.</li>
        <li>The page you submitted from and any campaign parameters in the URL, so we know how you found us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not collect payment details. The valuation calculation itself runs in your browser; only the submission
        reaches us.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To send your valuation report and respond to your enquiry.</li>
        <li>To follow up about selling or acquiring a business, where you have consented.</li>
        <li>To keep records of our own communications.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell personal data, and we do not share enquirer details with buyers or third parties for their own marketing.</p>

      <h2>Consent and withdrawal</h2>
      <p>
        We ask for explicit consent before you submit. You can withdraw consent at any time by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We will stop using your data for that purpose within a
        reasonable period, subject to any records we must keep by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Access and correction</h2>
      <p>
        Under the PDPA you may request access to the personal data we hold about you and how it has been used, and ask
        us to correct it. Write to the address above.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention and protection</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry data only as long as it serves the purpose it was collected for, or as long as the law requires.
        It is held in our customer records system with access limited to the people who need it.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no advertising cookies. We use privacy-friendly analytics that record aggregate page views and
        page loading speed without cookies and without identifying you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        We use service providers for scheduling, email delivery and customer records. They process data on our
        instructions only. Booking is loaded from a third-party scheduler, and only when you choose to open it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
